        "original_id": "af337628-8c57-5647-a5ec-e7b487d3f886",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Beijing, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China, Annam\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n- Buildings: Xiannongtan Stadium\n- Topics: prefecture-level cities, stadiums\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed Yuan Dynasty attempt to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei, and he ultimately died on foreign soil.\n- Xiannongtan Stadium is a multi-use stadium in Beijing, China.",
